Z||000005||Tigger||11-29-2001||06:10 AM||||Woo Hoo!!!  I believe my problem is solved!!!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Found 20Mb of free, no banners, no ads, no pop-ups, no "catches" web service.  It's called ENVY.NU.  Well they do have ads but they are on their pages not mine.  Here's the link,  <A HREF="http://www.envy.nu/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.envy.nu/</A> <P>I signed up and moved my site.  Looks a ton better without the banners!  No annoying pop-ups for visitors.  I'll setup my old link to forward to the new soon.<P>Tell me what do you guys think... <A HREF="http://www.envy.nu/fiero/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.envy.nu/fiero/</A> ||||reg||14
